1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,280
Woman: I bought a traditional recipe book and started learning how to bake.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:11,100
Man: That sounds great. How has it been going so far?

3
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,132
Woman: Well, with mixed success, my chocolate cake turned out fabulous,

4
00:00:15,132 --> 00:00:20,264
But my cookies, well, let's say I'm not going to have anyone try them.

5
00:00:20,264 --> 00:00:25,030
I managed to eat a couple, but only because I have strong teeth.

6
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,170
Man: You'll do better next time.

7
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:29,876
Woman: I hope so. In fact, I'm going to try again tonight.

8
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:34,200
I'm headed to the store right now to get some extra flour and sugar.
